  "Question": "If \\(p\\) is a necessary and sufficient condition for \\(q\\), record “\\(p\\) implies \\(q\\)” as 1 and “\\(q\\) implies \\(p\\)” also as 1. When both hold, what is the sum of the two numbers?",
